{:strongs 5203, :hebrew "יטש", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, to pound, i.e. smite; by implication (as if beating out, and thus expanding) to disperse; also, to thrust off, down, out or upon (inclusively, reject, let alone, permit, remit, etc.)", :text "本义为击打、捶击；引申义为（如同击打摊开而随之扩展）驱散；亦指推开、摔下、赶出或施加于（统含弃绝、任凭、容许、豁免等义）。", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:09:14.528287230Z"}